        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In April 2014, we entered into a Strategic Co-Production Agreement, Technical Transfer and Service Agreement and Manufacturing and Supply Agreement (the “EXPAREL Manufacturing and Supply Agreement”) with Thermo Fisher Scientific Pharma Services, or Thermo Fisher, to collaborate in the manufacture of EXPAREL.",
